>
>V3.2 (Prev. DEC OSF/1). Before I start playing with it, I'm trying to copy
>the
>
>OS-disk to the other disk.  But the dd command says: 'read only' filesystem
>(???).
>
>My question is: Is it possible to do an 'image' copy of disks on this
>machine, and if
>
>so: how?
>
>I should probably have read some more manuals before asking this, but if
>someone
>
>could point me in the right direction here, I will be very grateful.
>
>

shutdown to single user mode ('shutdown now')
for partition 'a' eg. SCSI 0 ---> 1

	dd if=/dev/rrz0a of=/dev/rrz1a bs=1b

all other filesystems with eg.

	dump 0f /dev/rz1g /dev/rz0g	
	...


