I have gotten the same message when my licenses were not updated/reset.
The last time was after I had updated the licenses, but did not do an
"lmf reset" afterwards. Licenses are also reset during a reboot, unless
you do like I did and accidently delete /sbin/rc3.d/S08startlmf (twice I
may add).

You might also want to check lmf to see if you may have multiple OSF-USR
licenses.
