To change the shell prompt of root user in a bourne shell simply add the
following  two entries in the $HOME/.profile - File of your root user:

PS1="`hostname`#"
export PS1

Thats all.

PS1 is an predefined shell variable that defines the primary system prompt.
You can also define a secondary system prompt (=PS2) which is used if a
command extends over more than one line.

