            CLRC Daresbury Laboratory
            Daresbury
            Warrington
            Cheshire
            WA4 4AD

We look forward to seeing you on May 25 !!

-------------------------------------------------------------------

2.  What is DisCo?

DisCo is the EPSRC's support activity for distributed computing in UK
academic research groups. The support is provided by staff at CLRC
Daresbury Laboratory.

DisCo seeks to advise and aid groups in the purchase, and cost
effective use of, a variety of computer hardware and software.  We
organise the annual Machine Evaluation Workshop, the ninth incarnation
of which was held last November, and provide courses in a variety of
topics, the latest of which is detailed below.  We are also currently
re-launching the DisCo Software Archive, and can make site visits when
necessary.

So if you are considering buying a new system on a grant or are having
problems with an existing system, please get in touch, we may be able
to help.

