Serguei Patchkovskii (patchkov@acs1.acs.ucalgary.ca) wrote:
: dd if=/dev/rrz0c of=/dev/rrz2c bs=512 iseek=1 oseek=1 count=65535
: dd if=/dev/rrz0c of=/dev/rrz2c bs=64k iseek=1 oseek=1

Ooops. This should read:

dd if=/dev/rrz0c of=/dev/rrz2c bs=512 iseek=1 oseek=1 count=127
dd if=/dev/rrz0c of=/dev/rrz2c bs=64k iseek=1 oseek=1

Mea culpa.

Cheers,

/Serge.P



